    "text": "Booking shows Vernon Richardson at Harris County Jail on Aug. 15\nBy\nI. M. AlanizVernon Richardson was booked into Harris County Jail in Harris County, Texas, on Saturday, Aug. 15, according to booking records.\nThe booking listed one charge, classified as violent. The listed charge was 'ASSAULT PUBLIC SERVANT.'\nRichardson had at least one prior booking.\nRelated Organizations:\nAldine\nAtascocita\nBarrett\nCity of Bellaire\nCity of Bunker Hill Village\nChannelview\nCloverleaf\nCrosby\nCity of Deer Park\nCity of El Lago\nCity of Galena Park\nCity of Hedwig Village\nHighlands\nCity of Hilshire Village\nCity of Humble\nCity of Hunters Creek Village\nCity of Jacinto\nCity of Jersey Village\nCity of LA Porte\nCity of Nassau Bay\nCity of Pasadena\nCity of Piney Point Village\nSheldon\nCity of South Houston\nCity of Southside Place\nSpring\nSpring Valley Village\nCity of Taylor Lake Village\nCity of Webster\nCity of West University Place",
